<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="AMO" style="id">- Zigua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Amosi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Amo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Amosi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha Amosi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Chitabu cha</para>
  <para style="mt2">Amosi</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu chino china uwoni wa muwoni Amosi. Amosi endaga mdimi ywa ngoto mwe isula ya 1:1 iviya endaga mlimi mwe isula 7:14. Vikaheza Chohile niyo amwitanga atende muwoni ywakwe. Amosi nendile akalwa komzi wa Tekoa uwo wendaga ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi yo useuta wa Yuda, mna ulosi wakwe wendaga kwachausa cho useuta wa ntendele ya chenya ya Izulaeli. Amosi alonga uwoni uwo umo Uzia akatenda seuta ywa Yuda na Yeloboamu II endaga seuta ywa Izulaeli.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ino yendaa hajihi no umhilimo wa 750 K. K. Kulisito henat kwelkwa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mwe izisula izimbili ze nkongo Amosi alavyaga uwoni weinkanto ya awantu mwe izisi zilozize, mna ulosi wakwe mkulu naukawalanga Waizulaeli. Chipindi icho chendaga cha kukula kwe isi ya Izulaeli. Umo Izulaeli ikachumilwa wamjalaga Chohile naho wawatendelaga vihiye wantu wachiwa mwe isula ya 2:6. Elo, ikanto ya Chohile mwa awantu awo yendaga ni kwigalwa ko usamizo mwe isula ya 7:17. Hata ivyo Chohile kalonga kugamba nawambize awantu wa Izulaeli kuwahuda awantu we izisi ntuhu nendile zikawalongoza mwechikale mwe isula ya 9:12.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yemndani</para>
  <para style="io1">Kwa ujihi. 1. Amosi etambalisa mwenye, mwe isula ya 1</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Vikaheza mwe isula ya 1 na 2, atambalisa nkanto mwe izisi zilozize.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Mwe isula 3-9:11 Amosi alonga mbuli za nkanto na kutahwa kwa Waizulaeli.</para>
  <para style="io1">Mo udumo Chohile alonga mwe mbuli za kuwavuza vituhu Waizulaeli mwe isi yawo, mwe isula ya 9:12-15.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="AMO 1" />
  <para style="s">Chohile awakantila awantu we hajihi na Izulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 1:1" />Ino ni milosi ya Amosi, uyo endaga mdimi mgati mwa awadimi nawakekala mo umzi wa Tekowa. Chohile amlagisaga Amosi izimbuli izo zose kuilanga Izulaeli mihilimo midi hechinati kulaila chisingisa che isanga, naho chipindi icho Uziya endaga seuta ywa Yuda na Yeloboamu mwana ywa Yehoashi endaga seuta ywa Izulaeli. <verse eid="AMO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 1:2" />Amosi agambaga vino, “Zumbe Chohile abuma kulawa ko ulugulu lwa Sayuni, avumiza izwi dyakwe kulawa Yelusalemu, madimilo ya wadimi yanyala, amani kulanga ko ulugulu lwa Kalimeli yanyuluka.”<verse eid="AMO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chohile aikantila Siliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 1:3" />Zumbe Chohile agamba vino, “Wantu wa Damesiki wakola masa nkanana kwa nkanana, elo sanileke kuwakantila, wawadamanyiza unyakwili wihise awantu wa Giliyadi. <verse eid="AMO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 1:4" />Elo, nandiselezeze moto idizumba dya Hazaeli, iviya moto uwo nauzitikimye izingome za umo akwikala mwanawe seuta Beni hadadi. <verse eid="AMO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 1:5" />Nantule inchili yo umzi wa Damesiki na kuwakoma awantu wakwikala mwe idibwandasi dya Aveni, hamwenga na chilongozi ywa Beti edeni. Awantu wa Shamu nawatahigwe na kwigalwa ko usamizo uko Kili.” Akulonga ni miye Zumbe Chohile!<verse eid="AMO 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chohile awakantila awantu wa Filisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 1:6" />Zumbe Chohile agamba vino, “Wantu wa Gaza wakola masa nkanana kwa nkanan, elo sanileke kuwakantila. Wawataha awantu mwe isi yose na kuwataga enga watumwa kwe isi ya Edomu. <verse eid="AMO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 1:7" />Elo, naniseleze moto mlanga mwe iviwambaza vyo umzi wa Gaza, moto uwo nauzikimye pele izingome zakwe. <verse eid="AMO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 1:8" />Nanimkome seuta wo umzi wa Ashidodi hamwenga na sekulu ywa Ashikeloni. Miye naniwebunge awantu wa Ekuloni na Wafilisiti wose wasigale nawakomwe. Akulonga ivyo ni miye Zumbe Chohile.”<verse eid="AMO 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chohile awakantila awantu wa Tilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 1:9" />Zumbe Chohile agamba vino, “Awantu wo umzi wa Tilo wakola masa nkanana kwa nkanana, elo sanileke kuwakantila. Watahaga Waizulaeli wose mwe isi na kuwegala enga watumwa uko Edomu, hawatongele amevano yo umbuya wawo wadamanye. <verse eid="AMO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 1:10" />Elo, nanigale moto mwe iviwambaza vyo umzi wa Tilo, moto uwo nauzitikimye izingome zakwe.”<verse eid="AMO 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chohile awakantila awantu wa Edomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 1:11" />Zumbe Chohile agamba vino, “Wantu wa Edomu wakola masa nkanana kwa nkanana, elo sanileke kuwakantila, wawatimila awalukolo wawo Waizulaeli kwa mabamba, hawawawawonele mbazi. Wajendeleza kuwebunga chila nkanana. <verse eid="AMO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 1:12" />Elo, nanigale moto mo umzi wa Temani, moto uwo nauzitikimya izingome zose za Bosila.”<verse eid="AMO 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chohile awakantila awantu wa Amoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 1:13" />Zumbe Chohile agamba vino, “Wantu wa Amoni wakola masa nkanana kwa nkanana, elo sanileke kuwakantila. Kwaviya, umo wakagomba nkondo kwangamula isi yawo wawatumbulaga wavyele wasoka mwe isi ya Giliyadi. <verse eid="AMO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 1:14" />Elo, nanigale moto mwe iviwambaza vyo umzi wa Laba na kutikimya izingome zakwe. Vikaheza zuwa dye inkondo nakutende na nguto zitendese, inkomano naitende nkulu uge nkung'nto. <verse eid="AMO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 1:15" />Seuta hamwenga na amasekulu nawatahigwe na kwigalwa ko usamizo wakatende watumwa.”<verse eid="AMO 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="AMO 2" />
  <para style="s">Chohile awakantila awantu wa Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 2:1" />Zumbe Chohile agamba vino, “Wantu wa Moabu wakola masa nkanana kwa nkanana, Elo, sanileke kuwakantila. Kwaviya wayatikimya amavuha ya seuta ywa Edomu niyo yatenda maivu. <verse eid="AMO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 2:2" />Elo, nanigale moto mwe isi ya Moabu, moto uwo nautikimye izingome zo umzi wa Kelioti. Umo wagomba nkondo wakavila magunda, maizwi yakevika wantu wa Moabu nawafe kwa luchenyenta lwe inkondo iyo. <verse eid="AMO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 2:3" />Iviya miye Zumbe Chohile nanimkome sekulu ywa Moabu, hamwenga ne vilongozi wose we isi iyo.”<verse eid="AMO 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chohile awakantila awantu wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 2:4" />Zumbe Chohile agamba vino, “Wantu wa Yuda wakola masa nkanana kwa nkanana, elo sanileke kuwakantila. Kwaviya walemela izigilizi zangu, naho hawatimile imiko niwagambile. Wadantwa ni milungu yo udanti idya ivikilwe ni wakale wawo. <verse eid="AMO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 2:5" />Elo, naniselezeze moto mwe isi ya Yuda, na kuzitikimya izingome za Yelusalemu.”<verse eid="AMO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chohile awakantila awantu wa Izulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 2:6" />Zumbe Chohile agamba ivyo, “Wantu wa Izulaeli wavuzagiza kukola masa nkanana zilozize, elo, sanileke kuwakantila. Wawataga wantu wata uwagila wangu kwa hela, iviya wawataga wantu wangu wachiwa kwa kuwahitulizanya na makwapa. <verse eid="AMO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 2:7" />Wawazila na kuwabunyanya wasokezi, wachiwa wawasente wasekwinkwa uwagila wawo. Mntu na ise wagona na mvyele yumwenga, mwe ivyo wajela uzavu idizina dyangu dikukile. <verse eid="AMO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 2:8" />Hohose hana mazabahu wagoli wagonela suche waguhile kwa wachiwa uge ukombo wa amadeni yawo, mwe inyumba ye imilungu ywawo wanywa divai waguhile mwa wadya wakuwadai.” <verse eid="AMO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 2:9" />“Nyuwe wantu wangu, kwachausa chenyu nawakomaga pele Waamoli awo wendaga watali uge miti ya mielezi na wata nguvu uge mti wa mualoni. Nakomaga amatambi na amaizi yakwe. <verse eid="AMO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 2:10" />Siwalavyani kwe isi ya Misili, siwalongozani kujinkila kwe idijangwa mihilimo milongo mine, niyo mwawahoka Waamoni isi yawo na kuwenkani nyuwe. <verse eid="AMO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 2:11" />Wamwenga mwa awana wenyu siwasagula watende wawoni na wabwanga wenyu wasiku wesente kwachausa cha kunisankanila miye. Nyuwe Waizulaeli, togolani yano hulonga sicho chindedi? Akulonga ni miye Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="AMO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 2:12" />Nyuwe muwatenda awo wesentile wanywe divai na kuwalemeza wawoni wasekulavya uwoni. <verse eid="AMO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 2:13" />Haluse naniwafiginteni saviya lingisha dimemile mzigo uzamile. <verse eid="AMO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 2:14" />Hata wadahi wa kugulukisa hawadahe kusumka na wata nguvu nawasilwe ni izinguvu zawo na wagomba nkomdo hawadahe kuhonya ujima wawo. <verse eid="AMO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 2:15" />Wata kulasa mwe nkondo nawasumke, wadahise kuguluka hawadahe kwehonya na wakwela falasi hawadahe kwehonya ujima wakwe. <verse eid="AMO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="AMO 2:16" />Mwe idizuwa idyo, hata wakankalu wa kugomba nkondo nawasumke hena viziha.” Akulonga ni miye Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="AMO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="AMO 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 3:1" />Nyuwe Waizulaeli, tegelezani mbuli alongile Zumbe Chohile zikulanga nyuwe, nyuwe wantu mwe isi yose niwalavize kweisi ya Misili. <verse eid="AMO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 3:2" />“Mgati mwa awantu we izisi zose, siwasagulani nyuwe du, elo, naniwakantileni kwachausa cho uwavu wenyu mdamanye.”<verse eid="AMO 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndima ya Muwoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 3:3" />Togola, wantu waidi wadaha kukonga ntambo hamwenga hawanevane kudamanya ivyo? <verse eid="AMO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 3:4" />Togola simba yadaha kubuma kumbago heinati kugwila? Togola simba ndodo yadaha kubuma mwdibome dyakwe uneva hainati kugwila chintu? <verse eid="AMO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 3:5" />Togola lufyusa heluna chambilo nalugwize kadege? Togola lufyusa lwafyuka helufyusigwe ni chintu? <verse eid="AMO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 3:6" />Togola gunda dya nkondo dikaila momzi hadikujela wantu nkama? Togola mzi wapatwa ni buli hediletigwe ni Zumbe Chohile? <verse eid="AMO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 3:7" />Chindedi Zumbe Chohile hakudamanya chintu hekuwagubwila wandima wakwe wawoni diya akunga. <verse eid="AMO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 3:8" />Simba ikabuma ni yuhi hekogoha? Zumbe Chohile akalonga, ni yuhi akunga alemele kuutambalisa ulosi wakwe?<verse eid="AMO 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samaliya yabalangwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 3:9" />Tambalisani mwa awantu wakwikala mwa amazumba ya seuta wa Ashidodi na mwa awantu wakwikala mwa amazumba ya seuta wa Misili, mkagambe vino, “Kwelunjeni hamwenga kwa amagulu yo umzi wa Samaliya mkakaule ngavungavu neivyo wantu wakuzilwa mwe isi ya Izulaeli.” <verse eid="AMO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 3:10" />Zumbe Chohile agamba vino, “Wantu wano hawamanyize kudamanya yedi, wowo wamemeza izinyumba zawo vintu vyo ubavi na upolaganyi. Hawamanyize kudamanya yedi. <verse eid="AMO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 3:11" />Elo, isi yawo nayebungwe ni mnkondo, uyo nabalange ahantu hawo ho kwegombela na kutaha ivintu vimwa amazumba yawo ye chiseuta.” <verse eid="AMO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 3:12" />Zumbe Chohile agamba vino, “Saviya mdimi akuihoka simba viga vidi mo umlomo hegu gutwi dya ngoto, nivyo nawachupuluke wantu wajeche du wa Izulaeli wasigale wakwikala Samaliya, na chihande cha lusazi na chihande cha suche ya kwegubika.” <verse eid="AMO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 3:13" />Zumbe Chohile mta nguvu zose agamba vino, “Tegelezani yano, mkaheza mkawafunde awelekwa wa Yakobo,”. <verse eid="AMO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 3:14" />“Mwe idizuwa naniwakantile Waizulaeli kwachausa cho uwavu wawo, iviya, nanizibalange izimazabahu zi mzi wa Beteli. Chila hembe mwa amazabahu nandikante na kudigwisa hasi. <verse eid="AMO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 3:15" />Nanibogozole izinyumba zose wakwila chipindi cha mpeho na chifuku. Iviya nanzibogozole izinyumba zawo zihambigwe kwa vintu vidamanywe kwa ugoli wa ntembo, mazumba makulu hayasigale hata dimwenga. Akulonga ni Zumbe Chohile!”<verse eid="AMO 3:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="AMO 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 4:1" />Tegelezani uno ulosi, nyuwe wavyele mkwikala ko lugulu lwa Samaliya, mkuneneha uge ng'ombe za Bashani zikudimwa vyedi, nyuwe mwawazila wasokezi na kuwabunyanya wantu wachiwa, mwawagamba wagosi wenyu, wawegaileni divai mnywe! <verse eid="AMO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 4:2" />Miye Zumbe Chohile Mkuka nelisa, “Mazuwa yeza, umo wankondo wenyu wakawakwesani kwa ndwana nkulu, chila yumwenga ywenyu natende saviya samaki igwizigwe mwe ndwana. <verse eid="AMO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 4:3" />Nambulumulwe kubula kwe ichiwambaza hantu habogozolwe na kwigalwa Halimoni.”<verse eid="AMO 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waizulaeli walemela kuhina kumwiva Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 4:4" />Zumbe Chohile agamba vino, “Nyuwe Waizulaeli, hitani uko Beteli mkakole masa, hitani Giligali mkajenyeze uwavu wenyu! Lavyani malavyo yenyu chila mtondo, mafungu yenyu ya mlongo chila zuwa dya katatu. <verse eid="AMO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 4:5" />Lavyani ntambiko za kuhongeza za mikate igwaduswe. Tambalisani chila hantu kugamba mlavya kwa kunga wenye, naywi mweduvye mwe izintambiko izo. Kwaviya nivyo mkunga kudamanya!” <verse eid="AMO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 4:6" />“Miye siwahozezani sala mwe chila mzi na kwigala gumbo chila hantu. Vyose ivyo hamniwiye miye. Akulonga ni miye Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="AMO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 4:7" />Iviya sichinda fula myezi mitatu umo mampemba yakonga fula. Sinyesa fula mwe mzi umwenga na kuunyima mzi mtuhu. Fula yanya mwe nkonde imwenga, nkonde ntuhu haikunya. <verse eid="AMO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 4:8" />Wantu wa mizi midi hegu mitautu wagulukila kwe mzi mtuhu, wakalonda mazi, mna hawapatile ya kuwachinta. Vyose ivyo hamniwiye miye.” Akulonga ni miye Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="AMO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 4:9" />“Siwegaila nkung'untu ya chifuku na kungugu vinyaze imigunda ne izinkonde zenyu ze mizabibu, sije zidya imiti yenyu ye mitini ne imiti ye mizaituni. Vyose ivyo hamniwiye miye.” Akulonga ni miye Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="AMO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 4:10" />“Siwaletelani unyonje wihise saudya nawigalaga mwe isi ya Misili. Nawakomaga awabwanga wenyu kwe nkondo, niyo naguha izifalasi zenyu zo kugombela nkondo. Vimba navivavagala mwe izinkambi zenyu, idihuzi dyakwe niyo dyawanunkilani. Vyose ivyo hamniwiye miye.” Akulonga ni miye Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="AMO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 4:11" />“Wamwenga wenyu siwakoma saviya niwakomile awantu we imizi ya Sodoma na Gomola. Wadya wachupuluke mgati mwenyu wendaga saviya chizinga chusigwe mwe moto. Vyose ivyo hamniwiye miye.” Akulonga ni miye Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="AMO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 4:12" />“Elo, miye naniwadamanyizeni imbuli iyo, nyuwe Waizulaeli, kwemalanyeni kudugana na Chohile ywenyu!” <verse eid="AMO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 4:13" />Chohile uyo aumbile amagulu na kumba mpeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:13">nuyo akuwagambila wantu fanyanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:13">nuyo akuhitula msi utende chilo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:13">Nuyo akujenda mlanga mwe ivinenangwe vye isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:13">Idizina dyakwe ni Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose.<verse eid="AMO 4:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="AMO 5" />
  <para style="s">Chinyulu Amosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 5:1" />Nyuwe Waizulaeli, tegelezani viya hulomboleza kwachausa chenyu. <verse eid="AMO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 5:2" />Wantu wa Izulaeli mgwa, si yendaga saviya mchiche hena mwana, naho henuke mpwii! Kwasigwa ichedu mwe isi yako, hahana hata mntu ywa kukwinula. <verse eid="AMO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 5:3" />Zumbe Chohile agamba vino, “Wagomba nkondo elufu imwenga nawafose mo umzi waite wakagombe nkondo, mna nawauye ni wagomba nkondo gana dimwenga du, wagomba nkondo gana dimwenga nawafose mwe kaya imwenga, mna nawauye ni wagomba nkondo mlongo umwenga du.” <verse eid="AMO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 5:4" />Zumbe Chohile awagamba Waizulaeli, “Nilondani vileke mjendeleze kwikala. <verse eid="AMO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 5:5" />Mna msekwita kunivikila Beteli hegu Giligali naho msekudeluka kwita Bali sheba. Kwaviya awantu wa Giligali nawaguhigwe kwigalwa ko usamizo na umzi wa Betali naubalangwe.” <verse eid="AMO 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 5:6" />Mlondeni Zumbe Chohile chani mwikale. Uneva sivyo nawalibukile saviya moto awelekwa wa Yusufu. Moto nauwatikimye awekazi wa Betali, naho hahana mntu nadahe kuukoma. <verse eid="AMO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 5:7" />Kaulisani nyuwe mkuhituila uwagila kutenda usungu na ukanuni mwautenda sicho chintu! <verse eid="AMO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 5:8" />Zumbe Chohile nuyo adamanye ntondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:8">zikwitangwa Kilimila na mabunga ya ntondo zikwitangwa olioni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:8">uyo ahitula ziza kutenda msi na msi kutenda chilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:8">nuyo akuyetanga mazi hamwenga mwe ibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:8">na kuyetila mlanga mwe isi inyaile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:8">Zina dyakwe nuyo Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="AMO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 5:9" />Nuyo akukoma wata nguvu na kubalanga izingome zawo. <verse eid="AMO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 5:10" />Nyuwe mwaweihiwa wadya wakugombela uwagila na wata kulonga chindedi mwe ivitala. <verse eid="AMO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 5:11" />Nyuwe mwawabunyanya wachiwa na kuwatoza ukombo utendese mo uvuni wavunile. Mwezengela nyumba za mayuwe ya kusongola, mna izinyumba izo hamzikale, mwalima nkonde zedi za mizabibu mna idivai yakwe hamuinywe. <verse eid="AMO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 5:12" />Kwaviya miye simanya ubanasi wenyu ulozize na ukulu wa amasa yenyu, mwawasulumiza wantu wedi, mwahokela fumbaso na kuchinda wachiwa wasekupata uwagila mwe ivitala. <verse eid="AMO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 5:13" />Elo, mntu mta ubala anyamala dwii mwe ichipindi icho, kwaviya ichipindi chiha! <verse eid="AMO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 5:14" />Uneva chindedi mwaunga mwikale hamwenga na Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose, seivyo mkulonga, lekani kudamanya yehiye damanyani yedi. <verse eid="AMO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 5:15" />Wihiweni wavu, munge wedi na kudamanya uwagila kwe inyumba ye chitala. Vyadahika Zumbe Chohile nawafile mbazi awelekwa wa Yusufu wasigale. <verse eid="AMO 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="AMO 5:16" />Ivyo nivyo akulonga, Zumbe Chohile, Mta Nguvu Zose, “Nakutende na ndilo ikulise chila hantu mwe izisila zose izinkulu na muntu mwa kuduganila. Hata walimi nawetangwe weze walomboleze na wata kulomboleza wakulihwa weze waike matanga. <verse eid="AMO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="AMO 5:17" />Naho mwe izinkonde zenyu ze imizabibu namtende na ndilo, kwaviya miye nanjinke mgati mwenyu na kuwakantila. Akulonga ni miye Zumbe Chohile.” <verse eid="AMO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="AMO 5:18" />Namluwone yuwe mkugoja kwa nkwina idizuwa dya Zumbe Chohile! Kwambwani mwadyungisa idizuwa idyo? Zuwa idyo naditende dya chiza sidyo dya ulangazi. <verse eid="AMO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="AMO 5:19" />Mbuli nazitende saviya mntu akusumka simba na kudugana na kala dikwitangwa dubu! Hegu mntu awiye kwe inyumba yakwe na kwegamiza umkono wakwe mwe chiwambaza akaheza anunkwa mmani. <verse eid="AMO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="AMO 5:20" />Zuwa dya Zumbe Chohile naditende chiza hekwine ulangazi, naditende ziza hedine ulangazi. <verse eid="AMO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="AMO 5:21" />Zumbe Chohile agamba vino, “Ngasu zenyu zo kunivikila nazihiwa naho sizibela, imidugano yenyu umo mkanivikila sikuibweda. <verse eid="AMO 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="AMO 5:22" />Hata hegu mwanilaviza malavyo yenyu ya kutikimya na mpuluzi, miye sanizihokele, malavyo yenyu yo utondowazi ya awanyama wadamane miye sanizisinye mpwii. <verse eid="AMO 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="AMO 5:23" />Nusizani lwasu lwe izinchemo zenyu! Sikunga kwiva lungole lwa visindamgunda vyenyu. <verse eid="AMO 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="AMO 5:24" />Mnaicho hunga niwone uwagilwa ujuluzike saviya mazi, mazuwa yose damani mbuli zedi, mbuli izo zijendeleze kudamanyika saviya mazi yakujuluzika mwe mto.” <verse eid="AMO 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="AMO 5:25" />“Nyuywe Waizulaeli umo mwendaga kwedijangwa kwa mihilimo milongo mine Mwanigailaga majeleko hata zuwa dimwenga? <verse eid="AMO 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="AMO 5:26" />Togolani, mwe ichipindi icho hemwenulaga matukulu ya mnungu ywenyu Sakuti savino haluse mwinule matukulu ya seuta ywenyu, na matukulu ya Kaiwani mnungu ywenyu ywa ntondo, vintu mwedamanyize wenye? <verse eid="AMO 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="AMO 5:27" />Elo, naniwegaleni ko usamizo hale vitendese kujinka Damesiki.” Akulonga ivyo ni Zumbe Chohile, Mta Nguvu Zose.<verse eid="AMO 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="AMO 6" />
  <para style="s">Wantu wa Izulaeli wakantilwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 6:1" />Namluwone nyuwe mkuhomola uko Sayuni, na nyuwe mkwewona mwikala mpeho kolugulu lwa Samaliya! Nyuwe mkwawona mwi vilongozi watana wa si imanyikise wakwegamilwa ni Waizulaeli wose! <verse eid="AMO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 6:2" />Hake hitani mkaukaule umzi wa Kaline, jendelezani mbule ko umzi mkulu wa Hamati niyo mwaseleza kubula ko umzi wa Gati wa Wafilisiti. Togolani seuta zawo hazidindimale kujinka izenyu na ahantu hawo saho hakulu kujinka ahenyu? <verse eid="AMO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 6:3" />Nyuwe hamkunga kuzumila kugamba idizuwa dihiye dyeza, mna kwakutenda ivyo mwadisogeza hajihi idizuwa idyo. <verse eid="AMO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 6:4" />Namluwone nyuwe mkugona mwe sazi zihambigwe kwa ugoli wa ntembo na kwegolola mwe makochi na kudya nyama za wana ngoto wadamane na ndama zidamane! <verse eid="AMO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 6:5" />Nyuwe mongisa kuchema nchemo za chihezi na kudamanya vimpandwa vya kuchemela nchemo mpya mkamtimiliza seuta Daudi. <verse eid="AMO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 6:6" />Nyuwe mwanywela divai mwe mabakuli na kwekuluguta mavuta ya kupwepweleka. Mna hamkuwona chinyulu mwa Waizulaeili ivyo nawakomwe. <verse eid="AMO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 6:7" />Elo, kwachausa icho nyuwe namlongole kwigalwa ko usamizo ne izingasu za wata kuhomola nazidume. <verse eid="AMO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 6:8" />Zumbe Chohile kelisa mwenye, Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose agamba vino, “Neihiwa vitendese nu kweduvya kwa awantu wa Izulaeli, nayawona maya amazumba yawo ya ntogozi. Umzi wawo hamwenga ne ivintu vyose viyumo naniwenke awankondo wawo.” <verse eid="AMO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 6:9" />Hata wanasigala wantu mlongo mwe nyumba imwenga wose nawabanike. <verse eid="AMO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 6:10" />Uneva mlukolo ywa awo wabanike aneza alavye ivimba kuse kwe inyumba vileke avyoke, anauza ni mntu yoyose eyaho hampezo he iyumba “Togola hana mntu mtuhu ehamwenga na weye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="AMO 6:10">Anahitula, “Bule hahana!” Uyo namgambe, “Nyamala dwii!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="AMO 6:10">Chikaulise hachikungwa kuditaja idizina dya Zumbe Chohile!” <verse eid="AMO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 6:11" />Zumbe Chohile akalagiza, mazumba makulu yabogozoka vihandehande na nyumba ndodo zaituka vihande vidodododo. <verse eid="AMO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 6:12" />Togola falasi zadaha kuguluka mwe luwe? Togola wantu walima mwe bahali kwa ng'ombe? Mna nyuwe mhitusa uwagila kutenda sumu, na ukanuni kutenda wihi. <verse eid="AMO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 6:13" />Nyuwe mweduvya kugamba muuhata umzi wa Lodebali na kwetogola kugamba “Muutaha umzi wa Kalinaimu kwa nguvu zetu wenye.” <verse eid="AMO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 6:14" />Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose agamba vino, “Nyuwe Waizulaeli, naniwegaile wantu kulawa kwesi ya chijeni weze wawebungeni, nawawasulumizeni kukongela Lebohamati ntendele ya chenya kubula kwedibwandasi dya Alaba ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi.”<verse eid="AMO 6:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="AMO 7" />
  <para style="s">Uwoni wa sije</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 7:1" />Uno ni uwoni anilagise Zumbe Chohile. Namuwonaga Chohile akaumba fyo dya sije na kuzituma, dino nadilaile umo awantu nawabinde uvuni wa seuta. Na hadya amani yakakonga kusuka vituhu. <verse eid="AMO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 7:2" />Siziwona izisije zikadya na kubinda chila zani mwe isi. Niyo nagamba, “Weye Zumbe Chohile, nakweila chiwonele mbazi suwe awantu wako, Togola welekwa wa Yakobo wadaha kutenda zeze na ujima? Kwaviya ni wajeche vitendese naho ni wasokezi!” <verse eid="AMO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 7:3" />Elo, Zumbe Chohile niyo ahituila izifanyanyi zakwe na kugamba, “Sanite seivyo.”<verse eid="AMO 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwoni wa moto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 7:4" />Zumbe Chohile niyo anilagisa uwoni mtuhu. Namuwonaga Zumbe Chohile aketanga moto wa nkanto ya kuwakantila wantu. Moto uwo woka imizimilizo ye ibahali na kukonga kutikimya isi inyaile. <verse eid="AMO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 7:5" />Niyo nagamba, “Weye Zumbe Chohile, nakweila leka kukantila! Welekwa wa Yakobo nawadahe zeze kutenda wajima? Awo ni wajeche vitendese na ni wasokezi!” <verse eid="AMO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 7:6" />Elo, Zumbe Chohile niyo ahituila izifanyanyi zakwe agamba, “Sanitende seivyo.”<verse eid="AMO 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwoni wa kobilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 7:7" />Zumbe Chohile kaninka uwoni mtuhu. Simuwona Zumbe Chohile kachimala he chiwambaza mo mkono wakwe anemezanemeza luzigi luna zuma dya kuhimila dikwitangwa kobilo. <verse eid="AMO 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 7:8" />Zumbe Chohile niyo anuza, “Amosi, wawona mbwani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="AMO 7:8">Namhitula, “Nawona kobilo.” Vikaheza Zumbe Chohile anigamba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="AMO 7:8">“Kaula nanijese ikobilo iyo kulagisa kugamba awantu wangu wesaviya chiwambaza chigonjize chikuse kwe ichihimo. Saniwawonele mbazi vituhu. <verse eid="AMO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 7:9" />Uko kwa awagulu wakuvikila milungu awelekwa wa Isaka nakubalangwe na hantu hakukile Waizulaeli wakuvikila milungu mituhu iviya nahabalangwe. Ulukolo lwa seuta Yeloboamu nanilwebunge kwa nkondo.”<verse eid="AMO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amosi na Amaziya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 7:10" />Elo, Mlavyantambiko Amaziya ywo umzi wa Beteli niyo amwigaila ulosi uno seuta Yeloboamu ywa Izulaeli, “Amosi aleta finju mwako mo useuta wa Izulaeli. Wantu wakwikala muno mwe isi hawakudaha kukwetegeleza chiya ukulonga weye. <verse eid="AMO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 7:11" />Kwaviya amosi agamba vino, ‘Yeloboamu nabanike mwenkondo, na Waizulaeli nawegalwe kwe si yo utumwa ihale vitendese ne isi yawo.’” <verse eid="AMO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 7:12" />Vikaheza Amaziya amgamba Amosi, “Weye muwoni hita zako! Uye kwe isi ya Yuda ukalavye uwoni wako uko, awantu wa uko nawakulihe. <verse eid="AMO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 7:13" />Hano ho umzi wa Beteli unasekulavya uwoni vituhu, kwaviya ni hantu akuvikila seuta, naho ni hantu hana nyumba ya chiseuta.” <verse eid="AMO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 7:14" />Amosi niyo amhitula Amaziya, “Miye suyo muwoni ywa kulihwa. Miye ni mdimi ywa ngoto na mta kutunduliya miti ye mikuyu. <verse eid="AMO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 7:15" />Zumbe Chohile kanilavya mwe indima yangu iyo yo ludimo, kanisigila nize niwagambile uwoni awantu wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="AMO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="AMO 7:16" />Haluse weye Amaziya tegeleza ulosi wa Zumbe Chohile. Weye wanigamba nisekulavya uwoni mwa Waizulaeli, naho nisekutambalisa mwa awelekwa wa Isaka. <verse eid="AMO 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="AMO 7:17" />Elo, Zumbe Chohile agamba vino, ‘Mkaziwo natende mchilanga momzi, wanawo wa chilume na wachiche nawakomelwe kwe nkondo. Isanga yako naisangilwe wantu watuhu, weye mwenye nobanikile mwe si heikukile na Waizulaeli nawaguhigwe na kwigalwa ko usamizo.’”<verse eid="AMO 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="AMO 8" />
  <para style="s">Uwoni wa ntangulu ina matunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 8:1" />Zumbe Chohile kanilagisa uwoni mtuhu. Nawonaga ntangulu imemila matunda yeviye. <verse eid="AMO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 8:2" />Zumbe Chohile niyo anuza, “Amosi wawona mbwani?” Niyo nahitula, “Ntangulu ya matunda yeviye.” Zumbe Chohile anigamba, “Uhelo uwabwila awantu wangu wa Izulaeli. Mo uwavu wawo, saniwafile mbazi vituhu mo uwavu wawo. <verse eid="AMO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 8:3" />Zuwa idyo, nchemo mwe Inyumba ya Chohile nazitende nchemo za malombolezo. Nakutende na vimba vilozese. Na chila mntu nanyamale dwii.”<verse eid="AMO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Awantu wa Izulaeli wakomwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 8:4" />Tegelezani nyuwe mkungisa kuwabunyanya wachiwa na kuwazila hewene chintu mwe isi. <verse eid="AMO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 8:5" />“Mwelongela wenye mwe imyoyo ngasu yo kutontomoka mnenge yaheza ini chani chikonge kutaga uhule wetu vituhu? Zuwa dyo Kuhumula dyasila ini vileke chidahe kutaga ingano yetu? Mwahunguza ivihimo na kukweza idiyombe na kudanta kwa vihimo vikudanta, <verse eid="AMO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 8:6" />Hata ngano mhanganye na mahofya mwataga mwawagula wachiwa kwa hela na hewene chintu kwa jozi ya makwapa.” <verse eid="AMO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 8:7" />Zumbe Chohile kelisa mwenye, “Hata hegu mweduvya kugamba mwi welekwa wa Yakobo, izintendwa zenyu zo uwavu sanizijale mpwii. <verse eid="AMO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 8:8" />Elo, isi naizingize na chila mntu mwe isi nalomboleze. Si yose naiyugeyuge, naikwele ikasela, saviya mazi yakumema na kuhunguka amazi yo umto wa Naili. <verse eid="AMO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 8:9" />Mwe idizuwa idyo, zuwa nadisele mo luwombo, msi nautende chiza. <verse eid="AMO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 8:10" />Ngasu zenyu nanzihituse zitende ndilo, nchemo zenyu za mbwedo nazitende malombolezo. Nyose naniwatendeni mvale majunia kwa chinyulu na kuwegula luhala imitwi yenyu uge mwalomboleza file ya mwana elekwe ichedu, zuwa idyo naditende dyo usungu ukulise.” <verse eid="AMO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 8:11" />Zumbe Chohile agamba vino, “Mazuwa yeza nanigwise gumbo mwe isi. Mna sidyo gumbo dya nkande na nchilu ya mazi, ni gumbo dya kwiva ulosi wa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="AMO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 8:12" />Wantu nawadwangaye kulawa kwe bahali kwita kwe bahali, kulawa ntendele ya chenya kubula ulailo wa zuwa. Nawaguluke wakalonda mbuli yedi ya Zumbe Chohile, mna hawaipate. <verse eid="AMO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 8:13" />Mwe idizuwa wabwanga wajimbale na wandele watana nawafe chififimbazi kwa nshilu. <verse eid="AMO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 8:14" />Wadya wakwelisa kwa tukulu dyo udanti dya Samaliya wakagamba, ‘Kwa zina dya mnungu ywa Dani’ na ‘Kwa zina dya mnungu ywa Bali sheba’, wose nawagwe hewenuke vituhu.”<verse eid="AMO 8:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="AMO 9" />
  <para style="s">Nguvu ya Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 9:1" />Nasimuona Zumbe Chohile kachimala hampezo he imazabahu, niyo anigamba, “Towa izintumba ze izinguzo ze Inyumba ya Chohile kubula umwegamo wakwe usingisike. Zigwise chani zigwele mwe imitwi ya awantu wose. Wadya nawasigale naniwakomele kwe nkondo, hahana hata yumwenga nasigale mjima hegu kusumka, chindedi, hahana nasumke. <verse eid="AMO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 9:2" />Hata wakasimba sila wengile kwe isi ya wabaninke, uko naniwalavye kwa mkono wangu. Hata wakakwela kwe mbingu naniwaselebule hasi. <verse eid="AMO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 9:3" />Hata wakefisa ko lunenegwe lo ulugulu lwa Kalimeli, uko naniwazungule na kuwaguha, hata wakefisa hale na miye kwe imizumilizo ye ibahali, uko nanidilagize idizoka dya mwe ibahali diwalume. <verse eid="AMO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 9:4" />Uneva wanatahigwa ni wankondo wawo na kwigalwa ko usamizo, uko weli nanilavye lagizo wakomwe kwe nkondo. Naniwang'oileni meso niwadamanyizeni yehiye sayo yedi.” <verse eid="AMO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 9:5" />Zumbe Chohile, Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose aidonta isanga nayo yazingiza, awekazi wakwe walomboleza, isi yose yakwela ikasela saviya ya mazi kumema na kuhunguka kwa mazi yo umto wa Naili kwe isi ya Misili.<verse eid="AMO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 9:6" />Zumbe Chohile kazenga wikazi wakwe kwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:6">isi nayo kaigubika na ulakanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:6">ayetanga amazi ye ibahali na kuyetila mlanga mweisi inyalise.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:6">Zumbe Chohile nidyo izina dyakwe!<verse eid="AMO 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 9:7" />Zumbe Chohile agamba vino, “Nyuwe Waizulaeli mwangu miye hamwesimile na awantu wa Isiopiya. Nyuwe Waizulaeli nawalavyagani nyuwe kulawa Misili. Nawalavyaga Wafilisti kulawa Kafutoli na Waalamu kulawa Kili. <verse eid="AMO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 9:8" />Miye Zumbe Chohile nausinya useuta una masa, naniwakome pele kulawa mwe isi. Mna saniwakome awelekwa wose wa Yakobo. Akulonga ni miye Zumbe Chohile.” <verse eid="AMO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 9:9" />“Nanilavye lagizo na kuwaheta awantu wa Waizulaeli mgati mwa wantu wa izisi ntuhu saviya mntu akuheta uhule mwe lungo, ivyo hahana hata mpuluzi ndodo naigwe hasi. <verse eid="AMO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 9:10" />Wakola masa wose mgati mwa awantu wangu nawakomwe kwe nkondo, wose wakugamba ‘Hachibwilwe ni nkomano, naho hachidugane nayo.’”<verse eid="AMO 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waizulaeli wadindimazwa vituhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 9:11" />Zumbe Chohile agamba vino, “Zuwa dyeza naniutogeze useuta wa Daudi ugwele. Hantu habogozoke nanihazenge uhya. Naniizenge vituhu izinyumba zibogozoke zitenda saviya zendaga mwe ichikale. <verse eid="AMO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 9:12" />Vikaheza Waizulaeli nawawalongoze awantu wakwila Edomu na awantu wose we izisi wendaga waketangwa wantu wangu.” Akulonga ni miye Zumbe Chohile, nanidamanye seivyo. <verse eid="AMO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 9:13" />Zumbe Chohile agamba vino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:13">“Mazuwa yeza umo mlimi akahaila uvuni nautende utoga kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:13">na zabibu zilozize wakufumbula divai nawadunduge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:13">chatimila chipindi cho uvuni we izizabibu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:13">Magulu nayatweke divai mpya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:13">na wagulu nawalavye divai.<verse eid="AMO 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 9:14" />Miye naniwavuze awantu wangu wa Izulaeli kulawa ko usamizo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:14">Nawazenge uhya imizi yawo ibogozolwe na kwikala umo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:14">Nawahande mizabibu na kunywa idivai yakwe ikulawana ne imizabibu iyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:14">nawalime nkonde na kudya ulozo nawavune.<verse eid="AMO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 9:15" />Naniwatende awantu wangu wa Izulaeli wekale mwe isi yawo wenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:15">na hawausigwe vituhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:15">Akulonga ivyo ni miye Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu.”<verse eid="AMO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 9" />
</usx>